DERS ACROSS 15 COUNTRIES AND FOUND THAT PEOPLE ARE FED UP WITH THE LACK OF PROGRESS SOCIETY IS MAKING TOWARDS SUSTAINABILITY AND SOCIAL INITIATIVES, WANT BUSINESSES TO TURN TALK INTO ACTION, AND BELIEVE TECHNOLOGY CAN HELP BUSINESSES SUCCEED WHERE PEOPLE HAVE FAILED.'}